  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/14250_shopping-story.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A: Sir, what do you want to buy?",
    "B: I'm very thirsty. Is there anything to drink?",
    "A: Yes. We have water, tea, milk, coffee, beer. What would you like to drink?",
    "B: I want a bottle of beer.",
    "A: Okay, anything else?",
    "B: Let me buy some food too.",
    "A: No problem. We have rice, noodles, and bread. Which one do you want?",
    "B: A piece of bread. How much is the total?",
    "A: Three and a half dollars for beer and ten dollars for bread, a total of thirteen and a half dollars.",
    "",
    "A: This is what you bought. Goodbye.",
    "B: Goodbye."
  ],
  "english_full": "A: Sir, what do you want to buy?\n\nB: I'm very thirsty. Is there anything to drink?\n\nA: Yes. We have water, tea, milk, coffee, beer. What would you like to drink?\n\nB: I want a bottle of beer.\n\nA: Okay, anything else?\n\nB: Let me buy some food too.\n\nA: No problem. We have rice, noodles, and bread. Which one do you want?\n\nB: A piece of bread. How much is the total?\n\nA: Three and a half dollars for beer and ten dollars for bread, a total of thirteen and a half dollars.\n\n\n\nA: This is what you bought. Goodbye.\n\nB: Goodbye.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "А: Госпо́дин, что вы жела́ете купи́ть?",
    "Б: Я са́мо́й жа́ждущий. Там есть что-нибу́дь попи́ть?",
    "А: Да. У нас есть вода́, ча́й, молоко́, кофе́ и пи́во. Чего бы вы хоте́ли попи́ть?",
    "Б: Я хочу́ буты́лку пи́ва.",
    "А: Хоро́шо, что-нибу́дь ещё?",
    "Б: Позво́льте мне купить не́сколько е́ды тоже.",
    "А: Не́ за что. У нас есть рис, лапша́ и хлеб. Како́й вы хочете?",
    "Б: Кусо́к хле́ба. Ско́лько сто́ит общее?",
    "А: Три́ с по́ловиной до́ллара за пи́во и деся́ть до́лларов за хлеб, це́лых трина́дцать с по́ловиной до́ллара.",
    "",
    "А: Э́то то, что вы купи́ли. Пока́.",
    "Б: Пока́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "A: Gospódin, chto vy zheláete kupít'?",
    "B: Ya sámóy zházhdushchiy. Tam yest' chto-nibód' popít'?",
    "A: Da. U nas yest' vodá, cháy, molokó, kófe i pívo. Chegó by vy khóteli popít'?",
    "B: Ya khachú butýlku píva.",
    "A: Khoroshó, chto-nibód' eshchyo?",
    "B: Pozvólite mne kupit' néskol'ko édy tózhe.",
    "A: Né za chto. U nas yest' ris, lapshá i khleb. Kakóy vy khótite?",
    "B: Kusók khléba. Skól'ko stóit obshche?",
    "A: Trí s pólovinoy dóllara za pívo i desýt' dóllarov za khleb, tsélykh trinadtsat' s pólovinoy dóllara.",
    "",
    "A: Éto to, chto vy kupilí. Poká.",
    "B: Poká."
  ],
